{"channelId":"UCZm2IEBVHdtaAhSyYhWu9mg","row":["Institute for Justice",527000,"Since 1991, IJ has come to the aid of individuals who want to do the simple things every American has the right to do—including own property, start and grow a business, speak freely about commerce or politics, and provide their children with a good education—but can’t because they find the government in their way.\n\nIJ combines litigation, media relations, strategic research, boots-on-the-ground advocacy and much more to fight on behalf of those individuals who are denied their constitutional rights. IJ is successful in winning over 70 percent of its cases in the court of law, in the court of public opinion or through legislative reforms.  IJ has litigated over 446 cases, including twelve before the U.S. Supreme Court.\n\nIJ has earned Charity Navigator’s top 4-star rating every year since 2001.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZm2IEBVHdtaAhSyYhWu9mg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZm2IEBVHdtaAhSyYhWu9mg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:23:13.078Z","channelId":"UCZm2IEBVHdtaAhSyYhWu9mg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"c67ca2e5b80068180504447385f866df8583635d7569de29fbed0279cd44cadc","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"51146ccd192a1647d2f7f9e20b0069a7ce58fe8904ede247855be0425290f87c"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZm2IEBVHdtaAhSyYhWu9mg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:23:13.078Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZm2IEBVHdtaAhSyYhWu9mg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":527000,"raw":"527K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZm2IEBVHdtaAhSyYhWu9mg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:23:13.078Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"single_sam